  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He stands on Shark Flow Lever in starry blue armor with a rough appearance and strong body, emitting a powerful rank eight aura. Fang Yuan identifies him as an experienced rank eight star path expert who woke from Heavenly Court’s immortal graveyard. Gu Immortal Qing Ye has the same rank eight status and controls Eternal Yacht. Xing Ye Wang looks at Fang Yuan with deep battle intent, intercepts with Shark Flow Lever, and is forced aside when spring scissors cut shark heads from the house. After repairs he charges again with Present and Past Pavilion and Eternal Yacht, shouting for Fang Yuan to face four Immortal Gu Houses together.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_shark_flow_lever",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_immortal_graveyard",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_qing_ye",
        "house_eternal_yacht",
        "house_present_and_past_pavilion",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a rough appearance and a strong body, and wears starry blue armor while standing on Shark Flow Lever.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On Shark Flow Lever his expression turns ashen when Year End Gatehouse reaches the river suppression lotus sealing formation. He later shouts for Fang Yuan not to leave and drives Shark Flow Lever at Fang Yuan’s back until Bing Sai Chuan blocks him.",
      "chapters": [
        1695
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chase-to-the-stone-lotus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_year_end_gatehouse",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Luo Po seal hits the river suppression lotus sealing formation, narration states that once the formation breaks, Feng Jiu Ge and Xing Ye Wang would be forced back into Immortal Gu Houses and Heavenly Court would lose battle strength in the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [
        1697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-break-risk",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Western Desert’s righteous path joins against Heavenly Court, he shouts that Western Desert’s immortals are the shame of the righteous path for helping demonic path Gu Immortals. Fang Di Chang answers by naming Wan Zi Hong, the Western Desert demoness Heavenly Court took in, and Xing Ye Wang is left stupefied and speechless.",
      "chapters": [
        1876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "western-desert-rebuke",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "char_fang_di_chang",
        "char_wan_zi_hong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court gathers Moment Stage, Present and Past Pavilion, Three Autumn Yellow Crane Platform, Eternal Yacht, Shark Flow Lever, and Sun and Moon Temple with Gu Liu Ru, Feng Jiu Ge, Xing Ye Wang, and Nine Spiritual Fairy around Myriad Year Flying Warship. After myriad year hunting fades, he moves Shark Flow Lever with deep killing intent and calls to kill Fang Yuan without waiting longer.",
      "chapters": [
        1883
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "six-houses-encirclement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
